44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, the idle specialist rooms suggest we don’t need more staff, just better allocation. I’m checking if redeploying those spare hours covers the unfilled posts.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Victoria, I found that projects rated highest were those open to everyone. I’m checking if our older blocks’ hidden hazards are why past projects disappointed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that aligns with my delivery data. Inspection-driven works stayed on schedule, while comfort-based ones slipped. I’m checking if our current options fit that pattern.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, if the hazards delay contractors, that’s a schedule risk. I’m checking if the tender drift covers those unexpected excavation costs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the tender drift covers those unexpected costs, why did the old gear’s lack of a reserve fund leave us exposed?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
