50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, so if we pick a plan that’s open to everyone, we avoid the disappointment trap. I’m hoping the data confirms that shared access is the key.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Mizuki**: @Victoria, so if we pick a plan that’s open to everyone, we avoid the disappointment trap. I’m hoping the data confirms that shared access is the key.""}]}"
