52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, rentals are a symptom. The tender drift means our base bids are already inflated, so we’re paying twice: for the work and for the delay.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
